{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他肯让想靠近的念头留下来，亲近对方的快乐又回来了。\",\n      \"key\": \"快乐又回来了\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他想被珍惜时，也记得自己真心替对方高兴过，不再觉得先前的体贴是在讨回报，心里有了些满足。\",\n      \"key\": \"讨回报\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他知道对方会不会回应不是自己能定的，也没得到新的保证，所以高兴时仍怕落空。\",\n      \"key\": \"怕落空\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S10-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S03-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S03-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S09-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S10-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R47\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S11-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留亲近之乐重新出现，把它接到上一段允许自己想靠近的松动上，避免写成回到最初的无知。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R48\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S11-2\", \"S11-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"拆分改写\",\n      \"why\": \"不再罗列期待的紧张、难堪等旧经历，而写出它们留下的两面影响：他记得自己真心替对方高兴，也知道对方的回应不是自己能决定的。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R49\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S11-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把不再用无所求证明体贴、不因想被珍惜而怀疑真心，落到他记得自己确实真心替对方高兴这一具体事实。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R50\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S11-2\", \"S11-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把抽象的愿望共存写成他承认期待、仍信得过过去的真心，并从中得到一点满足；风险和没有新保证另行保留，避免暗示对方已经回应。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": [\n    {\n      \"bead\": \"B4\",\n      \"why\": \"他终于能承认渴望、享受喜欢带来的内在满足，这一点由 S11-2 支持；但前面没有对方回应或给出新保证的事实。若珠子所说的期待终于得到满足，指的是关系上终于获得对方回应，就无法解释，不能硬补。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "2b5d8b1e-1d62-4aba-9ef4-544ca0d4ab7f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T100534408341Z", "elapsed_seconds": 766.766, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T10:18:21.191181+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e966405777d7ff288aeec1c2e6c9ca4675e7d61e5034ab861a84a26f54c6f383", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "o